Author: Drill Test <drill@test.local>
Date:   Wed Sep 30 02:01:51 2026 -0700

    Strengthen edge case test assertions

    Replace weak typeof/length checks with exact value assertions in edge
    case tests. Tests now verify the specific 'Hello, stranger!' fallback
    message, ensuring behavior changes are caught rather than just checking
    for any non-empty string.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

